              "body": "A longer quote sits well in the wall. Paste two or three sentences from an email or a product review here, and keep the customer's own wording."
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "testimonial",
            "settings": {
              "body": "Short quotes fit beside long ones."
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "testimonial",
            "settings": {
              "body": "Add the customer's name under each quote, and a picture if they sent one."
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "testimonial",
            "settings": {
              "body": "Set a star rating only when the customer gave one. Left at 0, no stars show."
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "testimonial",
            "settings": {
              "body": "Add as many quotes as you like. On a phone the wall shows its first part, and a button opens the rest."
            }
